always done we also we have a set of what we call&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:54.960
the hero questions where we ask things like what&nbsp;
does this character want because every character&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:02.400
is driven by by some intention and then we ask&nbsp;
how does this character need to grow and change&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:09.280
because the most interesting characters&nbsp;
