00:01:17.360 --> 00:01:22.640
growth or adjustment in them and that's that's&nbsp;
satisfying that's where some of the emotion comes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:30.080
from for the audience we ask what terrible thing&nbsp;
will happen if the hero doesn't get what they want&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:35.760
and that helps us zero in on the stakes&nbsp;
of the story for the the external stakes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:38.720
and we ask what terrible thing will&nbsp;
happen if they don't grow and change&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:47.440
in the way they need to and that gets at the&nbsp;
internal stakes and we ask how's the audience&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:52.320
going to relate to this character what are they&nbsp;
going to be rooting for in relation to this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.320 --> 00:02:03.120
character because we're really convinced that if&nbsp;
we are not rooting for our protagonist we're not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:09.040
